{"unit":9,"items":30,"pass":21,"title":"Unit Test · Unit 9","html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Unit Test\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Unit 9 &middot; Unit Test</div>\n      <h2>Body and mind</h2>\n      <p data-t=\"gx260\">Thirty questions on Unit 9 only. Answer them all, then press Check. You need <b>21 out of 30</b> to pass &mdash; and you can take this test as many times as you like.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"review-u9\">\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u9r101\">Part 1 &middot; Grammar &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 1&ndash;14</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u9r102\">Choose the correct form.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">If it &hellip; tomorrow, we&rsquo;ll stay at home.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">rains</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">will rain</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">is raining</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">If you greet people warmly, they &hellip; remember you.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">will</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">would</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">might</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">I&rsquo;ll call you when I &hellip; home.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">get</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">will get</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">am getting</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">We won&rsquo;t start until everyone &hellip; here.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">is</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">will be</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u9r103\">Put the verb in brackets into the correct form.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">(<i>finish</i>) As soon as I <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"finish\" data-why=\"After <i>as soon as</i> we use a present form, never <i>will</i>.\"> this letter, I&rsquo;ll send it.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">(<i>not come</i>) If she <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"doesn't come|does not come|doesn&rsquo;t come|doesnt come\" data-why=\"First conditional: <i>if</i> + Present Simple &mdash; <b>doesn&rsquo;t come</b>.\"> , we&rsquo;ll go without her.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"body\">(<i>see</i>) I&rsquo;ll tell him when I <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"see\" data-why=\"Future time clause: <i>when I <b>see</b> him</i>, not <i>will see</i>.\"> him.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u9r104\">Choose the correct form.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"body\">If the flu season is bad, offices &hellip; go back to the elbow bump.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">might</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">would</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"body\">Before you &hellip; the form, read it carefully.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">sign</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">will sign</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">neither of these</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span class=\"body\">If you don&rsquo;t wash your hands, germs &hellip; spread.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">will</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">would</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">might</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u9r105\">Each sentence has one wrong word. Click it.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"3\" data-why=\"After <b>if</b> we use the present, not <i>will</i>: <i>If it rains, we&rsquo;ll stay in</i>.\"><span class=\"ew\">If</span> <span class=\"ew\">it</span> <span class=\"ew\">will</span> <span class=\"ew\">rain</span> <span class=\"ew\">we&rsquo;ll</span> <span class=\"ew\">stay</span> <span class=\"ew\">in</span></span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"6\" data-why=\"After <b>when</b> in a future sentence we use the present: <i>when I arrive</i>.\"><span class=\"ew\">I&rsquo;ll</span> <span class=\"ew\">phone</span> <span class=\"ew\">you</span> <span class=\"ew\">when</span> <span class=\"ew\">I</span> <span class=\"ew\">will</span> <span class=\"ew\">arrive</span></span></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u9r106\">Write the sentence again so that it means the same.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"body\">Take an umbrella or you will get wet.<br>If you don&rsquo;t take an umbrella, you <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"will get wet|'ll get wet\" data-why=\"Result clause of the first conditional: <b>will get wet</b>.\"> .</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"body\">First I&rsquo;ll finish work. Then I&rsquo;ll call you.<br>I&rsquo;ll call you when I <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"finish work|have finished work\" data-why=\"Time clause takes a present form: <b>finish work</b>.\"> .</span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u9r107\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 2 &middot; Vocabulary &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 15&ndash;24</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u9r108\">Complete each sentence with one word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">15</span><span class=\"body\">In many countries people <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"shake\" data-why=\"<b>Shake hands</b> = take someone&rsquo;s hand as a greeting.\"> hands when they meet.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">16</span><span class=\"body\">A <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"nod\" data-why=\"A <b>nod</b> is a movement of the head down and up.\"> is a movement of the head that means yes.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">17</span><span class=\"body\">Very small living things that can make you ill are <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"germs\" data-why=\"<b>Germs</b> are very small living things that can make you ill.\">.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">18</span><span class=\"body\">Eating a lot of <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"junk\" data-why=\"<b>Junk food</b> is quick to prepare but not good for you.\"> food is bad for your health.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">19</span><span class=\"body\">Take a <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"painkiller\" data-why=\"A <b>painkiller</b> is a medicine that reduces or stops pain.\"> if the pain gets worse.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u9r109\">Choose the correct word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">20</span><span class=\"body\">Cycling and swimming are good for your &hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">fitness</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">disease</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">diet</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">21</span><span class=\"body\">Are we going? It &hellip; on the weather.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">depends</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">believes</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">consists</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">22</span><span class=\"body\">He was &hellip; for months after he lost his job.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">depressed</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">gentle</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">active</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u9r110\">One word in each group does not belong. Click it.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">23</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"4\" data-why=\"The others are parts of the body. <b>Respect</b> is a feeling.\"><span class=\"ew\">cheek</span> <span class=\"ew\">chin</span> <span class=\"ew\">elbow</span> <span class=\"ew\">respect</span></span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">24</span><span class=\"body\"><span class=\"errline\" data-err=\"4\" data-why=\"The others are things people do when they meet. A <b>trend</b> is a change in behaviour.\"><span class=\"ew\">hug</span> <span class=\"ew\">nod</span> <span class=\"ew\">clap</span> <span class=\"ew\">trend</span></span></span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-t=\"u9r111\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 3 &middot; Function &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 25&ndash;30</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u9r112\">Choose the correct phrase.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">25</span><span class=\"body\">If I &hellip; you, I&rsquo;d talk to her today.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">were</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">am</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">will be</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">26</span><span class=\"body\">&hellip; don&rsquo;t you take a few days off?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Why</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">How</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">What</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">27</span><span class=\"body\">You know the name of the person you are writing to. Which pair is correct?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Dear Sir or Madam &hellip; Yours sincerely</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Dear Ms Whitfield &hellip; Yours sincerely</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Hi Ms Whitfield &hellip; Best</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u9r113\">Complete with one word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">28</span><span class=\"body\">You <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"should\" data-why=\"<b>You should&hellip;</b> &mdash; the plainest way to give advice.\"> take it easy for a week.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">29</span><span class=\"body\">I am writing to <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"apply\" data-why=\"<b>I am writing to apply for&hellip;</b> &mdash; the opening line of a covering letter.\"> for the position of Junior Instructor.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-t=\"u9r114\">Put the three parts of the covering letter in the usual order.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">30</span><span class=\"body\">\n        <div class=\"order\" data-order=\"r1,r2,r3\">\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r3\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">Yours sincerely, Aisha Karimova</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r1\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">Dear Ms Whitfield,</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"r2\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">I am writing to apply for the position of Junior Instructor.</span></button>\n        </div>\n      </span></div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"checkReview(this)\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Check my answers</button>\n      <div class=\"res\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"reviewResult\" class=\"review-result\"></div>\n  </section>\n"}